flowchart TD
    A[Authorized source handle] --> B[Verify bytes and stage immutable file]
    B --> C[Publish version and active selection]
    C --> D[Replacement publishes another version]
    D --> E[Old citation retains original version]
    C --> F[Explicit revision-bound deletion]
    F --> G{Requested intent?}
    G -->|Detach| H[Remove named project reference and preserve surviving shares]
    G -->|Delete version or artifact| N{All affected references authorized?}
    N -->|No| O[Return shared-reference blocker without global deletion]
    N -->|Yes| I[Commit logical unavailability and event]
    I --> J[Clear active selection without older-version fallback]
    J --> K[Wait for admitted readers and backup holds]
    K --> L[Journaled physical unlink]
    E --> M[Exact authorized read or honest unavailable status]
